  "jobTitle": "AI Software Engineer",
  "summary": "Eric James Young is a machine learning practitioner and creative technologist who specializes in building applied AI systems that bridge code, design, and real-world business use. With a background in art direction, 3D design, and audio engineering, he approaches machine learning not as abstract theory, but as a practical tool for solving meaningful problems and creating intelligent products.\n\nEric develops AI-powered applications across multiple domains, including computer vision, natural language processing, and real-time data analysis. His work includes building sentiment analysis platforms that track media narratives, AI-driven SaaS tools that analyze video transcripts and surface actionable insights, and computer vision systems that match lost and found pets using feature recognition. He frequently integrates APIs, automation frameworks, and custom pipelines to move projects from prototype to deployable products.\n\nBeyond implementation, Eric focuses on system architecture — connecting machine learning models to dashboards, user interfaces, and scalable cloud infrastructure. He is particularly interested in how AI can augment creativity, enhance decision-making, and automate complex workflows. His projects often blend ML with design engineering, interactive web technologies, and audio software development.\n\nDriven by curiosity and execution, Eric builds practical AI solutions that move from concept to working software — prioritizing real-world application over theory, and product over hype.",
